w  State  fiscal  year  and  notifies  them  of  the  available  amount  via  the  letter  for  the  scheduled  June  payment "},"time":89806},"model_calls":41,"document_judgments":23,"relevance_3":8,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
